$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=mod2abs  LOC_AFTER=?

* The coefficient sequence ` ( k mod 2 ) ` of the eta series is a complex sequence bounded by ` 1 `: the ABS package of C4's Abel block at ` B = 1 `.

